# Configuration for fw_(printenv|setenv) / libubootenv.
#
# The U-Boot environment for this demo lives as a single uboot.env file in
# the FAT boot partition (mounted at /boot), matching the U-Boot
# CONFIG_ENV_IS_IN_FAT / CONFIG_ENV_FAT_FILE settings in the
# recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/swupdate-uboot.cfg fragment. The env size must
# match CONFIG_ENV_SIZE (0x4000) there.
#
# <device>         <offset>   <env size>
/boot/uboot.env    0x0000     0x4000
